  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the threatening dog scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the large, fluffy white dog, which is mapped as the speaker of the threatening text. The dog's intense, confrontational gaze and central placement create a direct visual link to the text, implying that the dog is the 'I' in the statements. This projection makes the user identify with or feel addressed by the dog's threatening persona, as if the dog is speaking directly to them. The text explicitly uses 'I' and 'you' ('these damn j'ws'), which directly addresses the viewer/user, reinforcing the projection onto the dog as the speaker.",
